                },
                "top" : {
                  "unit" : "px",
                  "value" : 0.0
                }
              },
              "rawHtml" : "<h2 style=\"font-size: 28px; color: rgb(0, 147, 58); font-weight: bold; margin: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; border-top: 1px solid rgb(243, 243, 243); padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong style=\"font-family: sans-serif, Arial, Verdana, &#34;Trebuchet MS&#34;, &#34;Apple Color Emoji&#34;, &#34;Segoe UI Emoji&#34;, &#34;Segoe UI Symbol&#34;; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">PERCHÉ SCEGLIERE CALIBRA?</strong></span></span></h2>\n\n<ul><li><span style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span style=\"color:#444444;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"> Accreditamento ACCREDIA secondo la norma UNI CEI EN ISO/IEC 17025:2018</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span style=\"color:#444444;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Certificati di taratura con validità legale e riconoscimento internazionale</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span style=\"color:#444444;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Dichiarazione di conformità inclusa, per garantire trasparenza e affidabilità delle tue misurazioni</span></span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"line-height:1.5;\"><span style=\"color:#444444;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Servizio svolto con imparzialità, competenza e massima riservatezza</span></span></span></span></li></ul>"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/html",
            "id" : "41cd25a7-358c-4ced-947f-5654c5f52016",
            "type" : "block"
          }, {
